# The golden token streams pin byte offsets, so the bytes of the inputs and of
# the expected files have to be the same on every machine. This repository is
# checked out with CRLF on Windows, which would move every span on every line
# after the first and make the comparison fail for a reason that has nothing to
# do with the lexer.
tests/golden/*.ot text eol=lf
tests/golden/*.expected text eol=lf